  "sourceTitle": "Broccoli & Cauliflower Slaw",
  "sourceText": "Broccoli & Cauliflower Slaw\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 12:23am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 sm. head cauliflower\n1 bunch broccoli\n1/4 cup green onions\n6 slices bacon, fried crisp\n1/2 cup sugar\n1/2 cup Miracle Whip\n1/4 cup oil\n1/4 cup vinegar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Chop cauliflower and broccoli and onions, consistency of slaw. Cook sugar and Miracle Whip and vinegar until mixed. Fry bacon crisp and crumble. Mix through salad. Yield: 8 to 10 servings.",
